msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"Did you know the Smile Burger over in Downtown Ryukyu is selling goya "
"burgers?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Oh, yeah. That's an Okinawan specialty. Have you tried it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Ah, so you knew about this already."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "Haha, of course."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid ""
"We get a lot of customers from the mainland, so we're always trying to tell "
"them something about Okinawa. Gets them real excited. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "Naturally."
msgstr "Per forza..."

msgctxt "472"
msgid ""
"They serve some rafute soba over at the Kariyushi Arcade that's supposed to "
"be really good. Full of collagen, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid ""
"Oh, you mean the soba stand in front of the Public Market entrance? I "
"actually haven't tried it yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid ""
"It's always so crowded by the time I get there, I never really got around to"
" waiting in line."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "You should. The Okinawan soba there is definitely worth the wait."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid ""
"Well, if you're the one who's recommending it, then maybe I'll invite a "
"friend and head over there sometime. Good looking out, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid ""
"So there's a bar in Hatsumachi called Aqua Sky, and they serve something "
"with their drinks you'd probably never expect."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "What is it? Some kind of appetizer? Is it... tofuyo?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid "Nope. The answer is... salt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "Salt!? That's it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid ""
"Not just any salt, but a special kind made on a remote Okinawan island. It's"
" called Maboroshi Salt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "Ooh... that sounds kinda cool. Have you tried it for yourself?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid ""
"Yeah, the bartender put some out for me. It's salty, but it also has a "
"sweetness to it that really makes your drink come alive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid ""
"Quite impressive, Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> There's nothing like "
"a gentleman who boasts a refined palate. <Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid ""
"Someday I'll be a true connoisseur, just like you. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid ""
"Do you know about Tantakatan? It's a shochu made from perilla leaves..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid ""
"Oh, that? We have that at the club. Or at least I think I've seen some lying"
" around..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "Well, what's the best way to drink it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid ""
"Um... I have seen customers drink it on the rocks, or maybe mixed with "
"water... but I don't know if that's any good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid "From what I hear, you're supposed to mix Tantakatan with juice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid ""
"Oh really? Well, if you're suggesting it, then I know it can't be wrong. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I'll give that a try sometime. "
"<Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

