msgctxt "796"
msgid "So, I heard that Smile Burger's offering a goya patty now..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid ""
"Yeah, and only the Okinawa branches have it. You told me about it last time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid "Did I?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid "Wow. You really are hopeless."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid "About the rafute from Okinawan Soba..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid "Oh, right... Sorry, but I haven't been able to go just yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid "Oh... Okay then."
msgstr "Oh... Okay allora."

msgctxt "880"
msgid "About that thing they serve over at Aqua Sky..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "892"
msgid ""
"Oh, that rare salt? I'm honestly not sure I could handle a round of drinking"
" with salt as my only appetizer. Sounds kinda rough to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "904"
msgid "Hmm. Maybe so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
msgid ""
"Guess I still have a ways to go, huh? Maybe I should have you coach me "
"through it. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Now wouldn't that be nice?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "928"
msgid "Have you tried out Tantakatan with juice yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "940"
msgid "I did. In fact, I tried it out with lots of different juices."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "952"
msgid ""
"Cranberry juice was especially good. Tasted just like a cocktail! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "964"
msgid ""
"And the fact that it was so smooth... was dangerous. I ended up drinking too"
" much. <Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "976"
msgid "Heh. Careful next time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "988"
msgid ""
"Right, right. But hey, with you making the recommendations, how could I go "
"wrong? <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

